    <BinaryModifier TargetProperty="NetSystemManpower"                      Operation="Addition"    Left="50"       BinaryOperation="Multiplication" Right="$(Population)"    Path="./ColonizedStarSystemStateColony,ClassColonizedStarSystem" SearchValueFromPath="true"/>
